{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17203080","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17203080","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1720308001:1":{"text":"若い男が折れた剣を握りしめ、絶望に沈みかけたその時――","source_cn":"就在年轻男人手持断剑，满眼绝望之际——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44AADFE2F21DA7BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1720308002:0":{"text":"柔らかな光が広がり、この世のものとは思えぬ神聖な姿がゆっくりと現れた。彼女こそが、女神デューラである。","source_cn":"一个神圣的身影缓缓出现，她周身笼罩在柔和的光晕之中，仿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4284E7374B877262","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720308003:0":{"text":"慈悲深き女神デューラは、人々の胸に響く不屈の叫びを聞き届けた。そして神の御業によって、この勇敢な若者に希望を授けたのだった。","source_cn":"仁慈的女神艾雅，听到了凡人心中不屈的呐喊。她降下神迹，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x432E03B283F95961","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1720308004:0":{"text":"顔を上げなさい、勇敢なる者よ。","source_cn":"抬起头来，勇敢的凡人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71A14309E8F870AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1720308005:1":{"text":"あ……あなたは……","source_cn":"您……您是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AE0921ECA793285","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","d